 can interact with tools and turn the valves naturally with your hands, just as you would in the field - no controllers needed! \nImmerse yourself in a realistic workshop, and navigate complex tasks with ease using visual cues and instructions. \n\nIdentify system issues, repeat and refine - practice until you can\u2019t go wrong!\n\nReady to scale your training? For our fully-loaded Standard and Pro versions, perfect for schools and enterprises, contact us at usa@skillveri.com.", "short_description": "Master HVAC servicing in VR! Practice brazing, leak testing, and refrigerant charging in a high-fidelity, hands-on simulation."}]}, "developer_name": "Skillveri Inc", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://skillveri.com/kelvin-lite-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Skillveri Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.skillveri.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "nl", "fr", "de", "es", "hu"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26679399678350607"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1698037978048407"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1698037978048407"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1777438920, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1698037978048407"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "An